# Agent-files convention: the central Devman link plane owns .agents and
# .claude. Both are symlinks, and neither is tracked in this project.
# Write the names with no trailing slash. A trailing slash matches only a real
# directory, not a symlink.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
.agents
.claude
